        "Real circular turns independently set pot and pan heat only on release; preview changes no time, temperature, or evidence.",
        "Escape and pointer cancellation restore the recorded dial positions without applying preview heat.",
        "Recorded settings and scene-dial provenance survive reload. Keyboard equivalents focus the real burner controls and apply the same engine values.",
        "Switching the pot off preserves its measured residual temperature and simulated time.",
        "Heat quests open the physical dials. Grabbing a dial pauses a running kitchen throughout the preview.",
        "Finished cooks and replay lock cooking tools and show recorded heat without changing evidence.",
        "Real touch rotates a dial at 390px, records only on release, and cancels without applying a setting.",
        "The close-up fits 320px. Graphics loss cancels the active preview and retains working text controls; accessibility scans include forced colors."
